WEBVTT

1
00:00:18.666 --> 00:00:19.565
Oh, guau

2
00:00:19.566 --> 00:00:20.399
Esta cama es tan suave.

3
00:00:21.233 --> 00:00:21.699
Ha pasado tanto tiempo desde

4
00:00:21.700 --> 00:00:23.699
